    <entry>
      <title>Linux文本检索 + Python计算器升级</title>
      <link href="/2026/07/29/Linux%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2-Python%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7/"/>
      <url>/2026/07/29/Linux%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2-Python%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="｜Kali-Linux-文本处理与检索实操"><a href="#｜Kali-Linux-文本处理与检索实操" class="headerlink" title="｜Kali Linux 文本处理与检索实操"></a>｜Kali Linux 文本处理与检索实操</h2><p>所有操作均在安全练习目录 <code>~/sec_practice</code> 内完成，不修改定制系统核心文件。</p><h3 id="1-测试素材准备"><a href="#1-测试素材准备" class="headerlink" title="1. 测试素材准备"></a>1. 测试素材准备</h3><p>通过 Vim 创建模拟日志文件 <code>test_log.txt</code>，写入不同级别的模拟日志行，作为后续检索练习的测试样本。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:00:01 info system start</span><br><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:01:23 warn low memory</span><br><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:05:10 error connect failed</span><br><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:10:05 info user login</span><br><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:15:30 error permission denied</span><br><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:20:11 warn disk space 不足</span><br><span class="line">2026-07-29 08:25:42 info task finished</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>操作流程：<code>vim test_log.txt</code> → 按 <code>i</code> 进入编辑 → 输入内容 → <code>Esc</code> → <code>:wq</code> 保存退出。</p><h3 id="2-文件查看核心命令"><a href="#2-文件查看核心命令" class="headerlink" title="2. 文件查看核心命令"></a>2. 文件查看核心命令</h3><ul><li><p><code>cat</code>：全量输出文件内容，适合小文件快速查看</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cat</span> test_log.txt</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p><code>less</code>：分页查看大文件，支持上下键逐行滚动、空格翻页，按 <code>q</code> 退出</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">less test_log.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p><code>head</code>：查看文件开头指定行数，常用于快速确认文件格式</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">head</span> -5 test_log.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p><code>tail</code>：查看文件末尾指定行数，日志排查高频命令</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">tail</span> -3 test_log.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><h3 id="3-grep-关键词检索与管道符"><a href="#3-grep-关键词检索与管道符" class="headerlink" title="3. grep 关键词检索与管道符"></a>3. grep 关键词检索与管道符</h3><ul><li><p>基础关键词过滤，筛选包含指定内容的行</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">grep <span class="string">&quot;error&quot;</span> test_log.txt</span><br><span class="line">grep <span class="string">&quot;warn&quot;</span> test_log.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>反向过滤 <code>-v</code>，排除包含指定内容的行</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">grep -v <span class="string">&quot;info&quot;</span> test_log.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>管道符 <code>|</code>：将前一条命令的输出作为后一条命令的输入，实现多命令联动处理</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cat</span> test_log.txt | grep <span class="string">&quot;error&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">ls</span> -l | grep <span class="string">&quot;.txt&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><h3 id="4-find-文件查找"><a href="#4-find-文件查找" class="headerlink" title="4. find 文件查找"></a>4. find 文件查找</h3><p>按名称、类型在目录中检索目标文件</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查找当前目录所有txt文件</span></span><br><span class="line">find . -name <span class="string">&quot;*.txt&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查找当前目录所有文件夹</span></span><br><span class="line">find . -<span class="built_in">type</span> d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="｜Python-计算器升级优化"><a href="#｜Python-计算器升级优化" class="headerlink" title="｜Python 计算器升级优化"></a>｜Python 计算器升级优化</h2><p>基于 Day2 基础版本进行健壮性升级，解决异常崩溃与单次运行的问题。</p><h3 id="升级功能点"><a href="#升级功能点" class="headerlink" title="升级功能点"></a>升级功能点</h3><ol><li><p>程序循环运行，支持连续多次计算</p></li><li><p>新增除零错误判断，避免除法运算直接崩溃</p></li><li><p>新增非法输入校验，非数字输入给出友好提示</p></li><li><p>支持任意输入步骤输入 <code>q</code> 主动退出程序</p></li></ol><h3 id="完整源代码"><a href="#完整源代码" class="headerlink" title="完整源代码"></a>完整源代码</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;===== 四则计算器 =====&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;输入 q 可随时退出\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    num1_str = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入第一个数字：&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> num1_str == <span class="string">&quot;q&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    op = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入运算符(+ - * /)：&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> op == <span class="string">&quot;q&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    num2_str = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入第二个数字：&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> num2_str == <span class="string">&quot;q&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 数字合法性校验</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        num1 = <span class="built_in">float</span>(num1_str)</span><br><span class="line">        num2 = <span class="built_in">float</span>(num2_str)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">except</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;输入不是有效数字，请重试\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 运算逻辑</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> op == <span class="string">&quot;+&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        res = num1 + num2</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">elif</span> op == <span class="string">&quot;-&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        res = num1 - num2</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">elif</span> op == <span class="string">&quot;*&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        res = num1 * num2</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">elif</span> op == <span class="string">&quot;/&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> num2 == <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;错误：除数不能为0，请重试\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line">        res = num1 / num2</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;运算符非法，请重试\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;计算结果：<span class="subst">&#123;res&#125;</span>\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;程序已退出&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="💡-学习总结"><a href="#💡-学习总结" class="headerlink" title="💡 学习总结"></a>💡 学习总结</h2><h3 id="收获"><a href="#收获" class="headerlink" title="收获"></a>收获</h3><ul><li><p>掌握 Linux 日志排查核心四件套命令，可独立完成日志内容查看与关键词过滤</p></li><li><p>理解管道符的组合逻辑，能够实现多命令联动处理文本内容</p></li><li><p>学会使用 find 命令按名称、类型查找目标文件</p></li><li><p>Python 掌握 while 循环与 try-except 异常捕获，能够编写更健壮的脚本</p></li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
